From c3c13c2bccf3e9a0b8faafbe14f28601c1912b0f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jochem Kuipers <jochem@kuipers.cc>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 00:50:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] android: host-no-mirror address space fallback on bionic

Ported from Kenji-NX libryujinx_bionic: when mirrored reservation fails,
TryCreateWithoutMirror plus MemoryManagerHostNoMirror keeps host-mapped
mode working on Android.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
---
 src/Ryujinx.Cpu/AddressSpace.cs               |  36 +-
 .../Jit/MemoryManagerHostNoMirror.cs          | 314 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../HOS/ArmProcessContextFactory.cs           |  31 +-
 3 files changed, 364 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/Ryujinx.Cpu/Jit/MemoryManagerHostNoMirror.cs

diff --git a/src/Ryujinx.Cpu/AddressSpace.cs b/src/Ryujinx.Cpu/AddressSpace.cs
